ArchiveCalendarResponse.description:
What archiving a family's current version did. `Version` is the family's current version, archived when Applied;
`DependentCount` counts the live schedules of active definitions that name the family in its scope, which reject
the archive while any remain.

DefinitionStatusCode.description:
Lifecycle status of a job definition. Numeric bands are a readability convention only;
behavior follows the explicit members. There is no per-definition Deprecated state by design:
operators pause individual Jobs via `IJobs.PauseAsync`.
